      ],
      "en": "Praise the LORD! Blessed is the man who fears the LORD, who delights greatly in his commandments.",
      "ko": "할렐루야, 여호와를 경외하며 그 계명을 크게 즐거워하는 자는 복이 있도다",
      "source_text_hash": "c62d70351af037d188820e24dc0268590e3d27e693c2f10e688267a349e87467",
      "translation_text_hash": "ed753bef8e0f8b2a81c5f088c5410dfd31bf1e6ec4f71312d14a61cdbd18d39c",
